t Lakṣmī identificirt.\n — β〉 verschiedener anderer Frauen HEM. PAR. 12,243.\n — c〉 Name der Dākṣāyaṇī in Dvāravatī.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "rukmiBid": [{"id": "rukmiBid", "headword": "रुक्मिभिद्", "headword_slp1": "rukmiBid", "fold": "rukmiBid", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*रुक्मिभिद् m. Bein. Baladevaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "rukmisasana": [{"id": "rukmiSAsana", "headword": "रुक्मिशासन", "headword_slp1": "rukmiSAsana", "fold": "rukmisasana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "रुक्मिशासन m. Bein. Viṣṇu-Kṛṣṇaʼs.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "rukmesu": [{"id": "rukmezu", "headword": "रुक्मेषु", "headword_slp1": "rukmezu", "fold": "rukmesu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "रुक्मेषु m. N. pr. eines Fürsten.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "ruksa": [{"id": "rukza", "headword": "रुक्ष", "headword_slp1": "rukza", "fold": "ruksa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. रुक्ष꣫ m. Gewächs, Baum.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. रुक्ष Adj. ungenaue Schreibart für रूक्ष.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रुक्षः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rukzaH"]}, {"id": "rUkza", "headword": "रूक्ष", "headword_slp1": "rUkza", "fold": "ruksa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. रूक्ष꣫\n— 1〉 Adj. (f. आ) rauh —, trocken anzufühlen; dürr, mager, arridus, saftlos. Auch von Speise, Arzeneien frei von Fett, vom Geschmack trocken auf der Zunge, kratzend, Geruch, von Lichterscheinungen das Auge unsanft berührend, Winden rauh, von der Hitze ausdörrend, von der Stimme und von Worten das Ohr —, das Gemüth unangenehm berührend, unwirsch, von Person unwirsch, unfreundlich, von einer Behausung unheimlich. Adv. in रूक्षवाशिन् (so zu lesen) KĀM. NĪTIS. 16,26.\n— 2〉 *m. eine Grasart RĀJAN. 16,89.\n— 3〉 *f. आ Croton polyandrus^1 oder Croton tiglium RĀJAN. 6,160.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. *रूक्ष m. = वृक्ष Baum.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रूक्षं", "रूक्षः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rUkzaM", "rUkzaH"]}], "ruksma": [{"id": "rukzma", "headword": "रुक्ष्म", "headword_slp1": "rukzma", "fold": "ruksma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "रुक्ष्म RĀJAT. 5,433 fehlerhaft für रूक्ष.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "ruksadman": [{"id": "ruksadman", "headword": "रुक्सद्मन्", "headword_slp1": "ruksadman", "fold": "ruksadman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*रुक्सद्मन् n. Koth, Excremente.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "ruksaganDaka": [{"id": "rUkzaganDaka", "headword": "रूक्षगन्धक", "headword_slp1": "rUkzaganDaka", "fold": "ruksaganDaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*रूक्षगन्धक m. Bdellium RĀJAN. 12,108.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रूक्षगन्धकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rUkzaganDakaH"]}], "ruksaRa": [{"id": "rUkzaRa", "headword": "रूक्षण", "headword_slp1": "rUkzaRa", "fold": "ruksaRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 Adj. mager machend.\n— 2〉 n. das Magermachen, Behandlung mit Mitteln, die das Fett mindern CARAKA. 6,11.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["रूक्षणं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rUkzaRaM"]}], "ruksaRatmika": [{"id": "rUkzaRAtmikA", "headword": "रूक्षणात्मिका", "headword_slp1": "rUkzaRAtmikA", "fold": "ruksaRatmika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-w